C) THE PRESERVATION AND PROTECTION OF GOOD HEALTH; AND
D) THE PROVISION OF RECREATIONAL FACILITIES IN THE INTERESTS OF SOCIAL WELFARE WITH THE OBJECT OF IMPROVING THEIR CONDITIONS OF LIFE.
2 TO RELIEVE OF PREVENT FINANCIAL HARDSHIP AMONGST PEOPLE IN BANGLADESH, PARTICULARLY THOSE LIVING IN THE SYLHET DISTRICT, BY THE PROVISION OF SUCH GRANTS AND DONATIONS AS SHALL BE THOUGHT FIT.

TO ADVANCE EDUCATION IN THE FIELDS OF SPECIFICALLY BUT NOT LIMITED TO DIGITAL AND PERFORMANCE ART BY THE ESTABLISHMENT AND MAINTENANCE OF AN ART GALLERY AND IN PARTICULAR;
THE PRODUCTION OF ARTISTIC PROJECTS; AND
FACILITATING THE DEVELOPMENT OF EMERGING ARTISTS AND THEIR AUDIENCES

