3. AFTER SCHOOL ACTIVITIES AND SUPPLEMENTARY CLASSES FOR CHILDREN;
4. SOCIAL AND RECREATIONAL FACILITIES AND EVENTS INVOLVING THE LOCAL COMMUNITY;
5. HEALTH PROMOTION, NUTRITION ADVICE AND KEEP FIT CLASSES IN ORDER TO IMPROVE THE HEALTH AND WELL-BEING OF THE COMMUNITY

TO ADVANCE THE CHRISTIAN RELIGION FOR THE PUBLIC BENEFIT IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE STATEMENT OF FAITH IN THE SCHEDULE HERETO ATTACHED IN SUCH PARTS OF THE UNITED KINGDOM AND THE WORLD THROUGH:
