• THE PROVISION OF FACILITIES FOR CHRISTIAN TRAINING AND SERVICE;
• THE SUPPORT AND PROVISION OF CHRISTIAN EVANGELISM AND OUTREACH;
• THE PROVISION OF ASSISTANCE TO THE WIDER CHRISTIAN CHURCH IN ITS MINISTRIES.

