THE ADVANCEMENT OF EDUCATION INCLUDING THE ADVANCEMENT OF ISLAMIC RELIGIOUS EDUCATION;
TO PROMOTE FOR THE BENEFIT OF THE INHABITANTS OF THE BURDETT ESTATE AND THE SURROUNDING AREA THE PROVISION OF ISLAMIC FACILITIES AND OR OTHER LEISURE TIME OCCUPATION OF INDIVIDUALS WHO HAVE THE NEED OF SUCH FACILITIES BY REASON OF THEIR
