THE OBJECT OF THE FRIENDS ASSOCIATION IS TO ADVANCE THE EDUCATION OF PUPILS IN THE SCHOOL, IN PARTICULAR BY:

•DEVELOPING EFFECTIVE RELATIONSHIPS BETWEEN THE STAFF, PARENTS AND OTHERS ASSOCIATED WITH THE SCHOOL, INCLUDING CREATING SOCIAL OPPORTUNITIES TO STRENGTHEN THE CANARY WHARF COLLEGE GLENWORTH COMMUNITY AND CANARY WHARF COLLEGE OVERALL COMMUNITY COMPRISING ALL CANARY WHARF COLLEGE SCHOOLS;

•ENGAGING IN ACTIVITIES WHICH SUPPORT THE SCHOOL AND ADVANCE THE EDUCATION OF THE PUPILS ATTENDING IT;

