AND PRESENTATIONS SKILLS, CREATIVE WRITING AND STORYTELLING AND OTHER ASSOCIATED
ACTIVITIES;

C) OPPORTUNITIES TO PERFORM IN THE COMMUNITY;

D) SUCH OTHER WAYS AS THE TRUSTEES MAY DETERMINE.

FOR THE PUBLIC BENEFIT TO ADVANCE THE EDUCATION OF SCHOOL AGE CHILDREN IN NATIONAL CURRICULUM SUBJECTS AND ISLAMIC STUDIES BY:

A) PROVIDING AND MAINTAINING AN INDEPENDENT SCHOOL;
